  ],
  "abstract": "We develop a diagrammatic formalism for calculating the Alexander polynomial of the closure of a braid as a state-sum. Our main tools ar e the Markov trace formulas for the HOMFLY-PT polynomial and Young\u2019s semi-nor mal repre- sentations of the Iwahori-Hecke algebras of type A.",
